VT220 reverse video for the pane text selection (herdr 0.8.0).

herdr computes the selection highlight in code; there is no theme token for
it, so config.toml cannot reach it. See src/ui/panes.rs automatic_selection_bg.

Not sent upstream: the fix is only correct for a monochrome palette.

